# Codigrate Roraima
#
# Category: Nature
#
# Description:
# Inspired by the captivating sunset over Mount Roraima, this dark theme seamlessly blends the deep twilight
# hues of blues and purples with the fiery brilliance of oranges and yellows. Evoking the serene majesty of
# Roraima as day transitions to night, this balanced palette offers a soothing yet invigorating backdrop,
# ensuring an optimal and focused coding experience.
#
# For more information about the color theory behind:
# https://codigrate.com

# --- Interface colors ---

# Background uses editorBackground first because Ghostty is a reading surface.
background = #1E1A1B
foreground = #D0CCCD

selection-background = #562F2F
selection-foreground = #D0CCCD

cursor-color = #DF6F50
cursor-text = #171415

# --- ANSI 16-color palette ---
